spooky characters\u2014like a Zombie Dog, a dead Joker, and even an eerie Mummy. Each challenge will test your nerves and your puzzle-solving skills. The best part? You can play it alone or with a friend!\n\nThe game offers two modes:\n- Solo Mode: It\u2019s just you against the haunted room\u2014get out before it\u2019s too late!\n- Co-op Mode: Work with a friend to help each other escape. Can you both survive?\n\nKey Features:\n- Play solo or team up in co-op mode.\n- Face off against creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, a Zombie Dog, and more.\n- High-quality VR graphics for an immersive, hair-raising experience.\n- Puzzles that challenge your brain while keeping your heart racing.\n- Exclusively available on Oculus Quest.", "short_description": "Get ready for a spooky adventure in Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games! You\u2019re trapped in a haunted room, and it\u2019s up to you to find a way out. Face creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, and even a Zombie Dog. Whether you're going solo or teaming up with a friend, every moment counts!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/futlixgames/privacy-policy/meta-oculus-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futlix Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/futlixgames/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_track